## 4. UI Layout & Upgrade System Data Structures

The upgrade screen displays an overlay with **three random selections** from the following declarative upgrade matrix array:

```javascript
const UPGRADE_POOL = [
  { id: 'speed', name: 'Agility Boost', desc: 'Increase movement speed by 15%', effect: (p) => p.speed *= 1.15 },
  { id: 'damage', name: 'Heavy Impact', desc: 'Increase all weapon damage by 20%', effect: (p) => p.damageModifier *= 1.20 },
  { id: 'cooldown', name: 'Hyper-drive', desc: 'Reduce attack cooldowns by 10%', effect: (p) => p.cooldownModifier *= 0.90 },
  { id: 'unlock_ring', name: 'Fire Ring', desc: 'Unlock an orbiting barrier of fire', effect: (p) => p.unlockWeapon('fire_ring') }
];

```

